  <div class="eyebrow">VOL. 01 &bull; PRODUCT FIELD GUIDE &amp; ENGINEERING JOURNAL</div>
  <h1>Tasks+</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">A calm, tactile Android workspace for daily momentum, focus sprints, family accountability, and mindful screen-time habits.</p>

  <table class="stats">
    <tr>
      <td><div class="stat-big">~17 Hours</div><div class="stat-small">4 Iterative Phases</div></td>
      <td><div class="stat-big">API 23–36</div><div class="stat-small">Android 6 to 16</div></td>
      <td><div class="stat-big">Offline + Cloud</div><div class="stat-small">Room &amp; Firestore</div></td>
      <td style="border-right:none;"><div class="stat-big">Material 3</div><div class="stat-small">Expressive Compose</div></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3>Everyday Uses &amp; Purpose</h3>

  <div class="card card-emerald">
    <div class="card-title">01 &nbsp;Personal Daily Planning &amp; Habit Routines</div>
    <p class="card-text">Organize one-time errands and repeating Daily, Weekly, Custom-Day, Monthly, or Annual routines with optional color-coded categories, urgency thermometers, and a collapsible Upcoming Recurring drawer that keeps today's focus list clutter-free.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title">02 &nbsp;Time-Boxed Focus Sprints</div>
    <p class="card-text">Pair selected tasks with a live countdown timer accessible inside Settings, persistent notifications, and a home-screen widget—backed by a guaranteed high-priority Time's Up alert when the sprint ends.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card card-violet">
    <div class="card-title">03 &nbsp;Family &amp; Team Accountability</div>
    <p class="card-text">Build shared Family or Organization groups with Manager, Parent/Admin, Member, and Child roles. Assign tasks, attach optional photo proof, and verify completions automatically with Firebase AI Logic (Gemini) or manual approval.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card card-coral">
    <div class="card-title">04 &nbsp;Mindful Screen-Time &amp; Positive Motivation</div>
    <p class="card-text">Set hourly, daily, or weekly per-app usage limits and task-gated app locks, reward early completions with customizable Credit Points, unlock profile emblems, and compare progress on the opt-in Global Leaderboard.</p>
  </div>

  <table class="footer-bar"><tr><td>CRAFTED BY FROSTY-SYS &bull; KOTLIN &amp; JETPACK COMPOSE</td><td align="right">PAGE 01 / 04</td></tr></table>

  <!-- ==================== PAGE 2 ==================== -->
  <br class="page-break" />
  <table class="header-bar"><tr><td>TASKS+ &bull; PROJECT DIARY BOOKLET</td><td align="right">02 / FEATURES &amp; FUNCTIONS</td></tr></table>

  <h2>Features &amp; Core Functions</h2>
  <p class="card-text" style="margin-bottom:10pt;">Every module in Tasks+ is built offline-first for zero-latency responsiveness while syncing seamlessly across devices when signed in with Google.</p>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title">01 &nbsp;Optional Color-Coded Categories &amp; Tactile Checklists</div>
    <p class="card-text">Enable or disable Task Categories anytime in Settings. Includes 6 premade categories (Work, Personal, Shopping, Health, Study, Home), up to 30 custom categories across 10 curated colors, a slim top filter bar on To-Do, color-coded task card badges, instant search, and a radial ripple + spring-popped checkmark completion animation.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card card-coral">
    <div class="card-title">02 &nbsp;1–5 Urgency Thermometer &amp; Priority Reminder Engine</div>
    <p class="card-text">Slide edge-to-edge across a custom green-to-red thermometer from Calm (1) to Critical (5). Supports configurable interval reminders powered by AlarmManager, optional wake-up alarm bells, and guided permission checks for Notifications, Exact Alarms, Overlay, and Battery Optimization.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card card-amber">
    <div class="card-title">03 &nbsp;Task Countdown Timer &amp; Guaranteed Time's Up Alert</div>
    <p class="card-text">Select one or more tasks for a focus sprint, set custom durations, pause/resume or mark tasks complete mid-session, monitor live countdowns in persistent notifications and the Task Timer Home Widget, and receive an unmistakable Time's Up alert when the timer expires.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card card-emerald">
    <div class="card-title">04 &nbsp;Daily Productivity Grouped Bar Chart Dashboard</div>
    <p class="card-text">Inspect Completed vs. Pending tasks across Today or the past 7 Days in an interactive grouped bar chart—available both as a toggleable in-app dashboard card and as a resizable Android Home-Screen Widget.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card card-violet">
    <div class="card-title">05 &nbsp;Family &amp; Team Groups, Gemini AI Photo Proof &amp; Screen-Time Locks</div>
    <p class="card-text">Invite members via email, manage delegated roles, verify photo proofs via Firebase AI Logic (Gemini) auto-approval, track real-time app usage via UsageStatsManager, and enforce per-app limits or task-to-unlock rewards.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title">06 &nbsp;Credit Economy, Global Leaderboard, M3 Themes &amp; In-App Updater</div>
    <p class="card-text">Customize early-completion rewards, grace periods, and late penalties with an immutable credit ledger, unlock profile emblems, climb the opt-in Global Leaderboard, personalize with Dynamic Wallpaper Color + 5 tonal palettes, and install releases via the built-in GitHub APK updater.</p>
  </div>

  <table class="footer-bar"><tr><td>OFFLINE-FIRST ROOM SQLITE + REAL-TIME CLOUD SYNC</td><td align="right">PAGE 02 / 04</td></tr></table>

  <!-- ==================== PAGE 3 ==================== -->
  <br class="page-break" />
  <table class="header-bar"><tr><td>TASKS+ &bull; PROJECT DIARY BOOKLET</td><td align="right">03 / BUILD DIARY &amp; STACK</td></tr></table>

  <h2>How It Was Made: Build Diary (~17 Hours)</h2>
  <p class="card-text" style="margin-bottom:10pt;">Tasks+ evolved across four structured phases—progressing from an offline-first Material 3 core to cloud sync, group accountability, gamification, and fine-grained visual polish.</p>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title">PHASE 01 &bull; ~4 HOURS &mdash; Core Task Engine &amp; Material 3 Foundation</div>
    <p class="card-text">Designed the Jetpack Compose Material 3 interface, custom adaptive launcher icon, Room SQLite database, recurring occurrence engine, AlarmManager reminder pipeline, dynamic theming, and Android home-screen widgets.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card card-violet">
    <div class="card-title">PHASE 02 &bull; ~6 HOURS &mdash; Cloud Sync, Groups &amp; Screen-Time Enforcement</div>
    <p class="card-text">Integrated Google Sign-In via Jetpack Credential Manager, real-time Firestore sync backed by zero-trust security rules, Family/Team groups with role permissions, Firebase AI Logic (Gemini) photo verification, and UsageStatsManager screen-time locks.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card card-emerald">
    <div class="card-title">PHASE 03 &bull; ~4 HOURS &mdash; Gamification, Timer &amp; Productivity Analytics</div>
    <p class="card-text">Built the customizable credit scoring rules, unlockable profile emblems, opt-in Global Leaderboard, live Task Countdown Timer (persistent notification + widget + Time's Up alert), and the 7-day Daily Productivity Grouped Bar Chart.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card card-coral">
    <div class="card-title">PHASE 04 &bull; ~3 HOURS &mdash; Visual Polish, Categories &amp; Hardening</div>
    <p class="card-text">Refined the full-width 1–5 Urgency Thermometer slider, crafted the radial ripple &amp; stroke-drawn checkmark animation, built optional Premade &amp; Custom Task Categories with a compact top filter bar, resolved recurring sync duplication, and added Robolectric &amp; Firestore Rules test suites.</p>
  </div>

  <h3>Technical Architecture &amp; Stack</h3>
  <table class="styled">
    <tr><th>UI &amp; Motion</th><td>Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, Material Design 3, Custom Canvas Graphics, Spring &amp; Keyframe Animations</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Architecture</th><td>Offline-first MVVM (TasksPlusViewModel, StateFlow, collectAsStateWithLifecycle, Coroutines)</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Local Storage</th><td>Room SQLite (Schema v8 with lossless migrations) + Jetpack DataStore Preferences</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Cloud &amp; Security</th><td>Firebase Firestore (named DB + strict zero-trust rules), Firebase Auth, Credential Manager, App Check</td></tr>
    <tr><th>AI &amp; System APIs</th><td>Firebase AI Logic (Gemini photo verification), AlarmManager, UsageStatsManager, AppWidgets, OkHttp</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Quality &amp; Tests</th><td>Robolectric JVM test suites (API 23–36) &amp; 9 automated Firestore Security Rules unit tests</td></tr>
  </table>

  <table class="footer-bar"><tr><td>~17 HOURS &bull; 4 PHASES &bull; ROOM V8 + ZERO-TRUST FIRESTORE</td><td align="right">PAGE 03 / 04</td></tr></table>

  <!-- ==================== PAGE 4 ==================== -->
  <br class="page-break" />
  <table class="header-bar"><tr><td>TASKS+ &bull; PROJECT DIARY BOOKLET</td><td align="right">04 / REFLECTIONS &amp; COLOPHON</td></tr></table>

  <h2>Engineering Notes &amp; Lessons Learned</h2>

  <div class="card card-emerald">
    <div class="card-title">01 &nbsp;Eliminating Daily Recurring Task Duplication Across Sync</div>
    <p class="card-text">Kotlin's <i>isCompleted</i> boolean getter naming caused Firestore reflection to miss completed snapshots on recurring tasks, spawning duplicates. Switching to explicit snapshot parsing, @PropertyName parity, atomic Room + Cloud upserts, and a collapsible Upcoming Recurring drawer made daily routines rock-solid.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card card-coral">
    <div class="card-title">02 &nbsp;Guaranteed Time's Up Notifications Under Android OS Limits</div>
    <p class="card-text">Background restrictions can delay ordinary countdowns. Combining exact AlarmManager triggers, synchronous broadcast handling, and a dedicated high-priority notification channel ensures Time's Up alerts fire reliably even when the phone is locked.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title">03 &nbsp;Custom Tactile Craft From Android 6.0 to Android 16</div>
    <p class="card-text">Supporting minSdk 23 through API 36 meant drawing custom Canvas visuals—including the edge-to-edge Urgency Thermometer, Productivity Bar Chart, and Radial Ripple Checkmark—without relying on modern-only APIs, backed by automated Marshmallow Robolectric tests.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card card-violet">
    <div class="card-title">04 &nbsp;Zero-Trust Security Parity on Every Schema Change</div>
    <p class="card-text">Every feature addition—Groups, Credit Ledgers, Global Leaderboard, and Task Categories—was mirrored 1:1 across Room migrations, Firestore rules, and a 9-test local emulator suite before deployment.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="quote">
    &ldquo;Great productivity software respects your attention&mdash;<br />
    gentle when you're in flow, unmistakable when it matters.&rdquo;
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="eyebrow">COLOPHON &bull; TASKS+ PROJECT DIARY</div>
    <p class="card-text" style="margin-bottom:6pt;">Designed as an editorial 4-page project diary ready to open in Microsoft Word, Google Docs, or LibreOffice Writer, and easy to export to PDF or share across social media.</p>
    <p style="margin:0; font-family:Georgia, serif; font-weight:bold; font-size:10.5pt;">Crafted with care by frosty-sys &bull; Tasks+ Android Edition (tasksplus)</p>
